<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Add_a_new_topic_by_creating_a_new_header_like_this_one">Add a new topic by creating a new header like this one</span></h2>
<p>And then write your comment below it. Sign your comment with four tildes, like so: ~~~~. It is automatically substituted with your user name and a link to your user page.
</p>
<dl><dd>To respond to someone else's comment, use a colon at the beginning of your response to indent it.</dd></dl>
<dl><dd><dl><dd>Two colons indent twice, and so forth.</dd></dl></dd></dl>
